[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i76"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“镜子阿姨，能打扰一下吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11667"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“请看一下这个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11660"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“地图？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这附近一带，是什么样的地方啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11667"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“是山。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有没有洞窟之类的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11685"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“与其说是洞窟。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“其实是个采石场。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11686"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“所以，也许会有形成类似洞窟一样的地方吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是这样啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"似乎真的有洞窟一样的地方。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11652"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“羽依里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11651"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不可以哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11652"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“因为会有小孩子想进去，所以那里已经被封闭了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11663"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“岛上的孩子们被学校的老师严厉告诫不准进入的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11667"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“来岛上参观的人也不会想要进去。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“而且那也不是随便乱走就能找到的地方。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11663"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我不知道你的地图是哪里搞来的。但是，即使感兴趣也不准进入。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎呀，我只是问问而已。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么可能会去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11651"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“你打算去给我看的地图上面的地方吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊哈哈。说什么呢，我怎么会做那么孩子气的事情。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11656"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“盯―……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11667"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“要是你打算去这里的话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“的话？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11647"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我就告诉你家里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"抖抖抖抖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唯独这点放过我吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]